flowchart TB
  Q[BioASQ question + type] --> P[Validate + normalize + split]
  C[(Abstract corpus)] --> P
  P --> L[BM25 lexical index]
  P --> S[Distributional n-gram vectors]
  L --> F[Weighted hybrid retrieval]
  S --> F
  F --> H[HMM/Viterbi evidence selector]
  H --> X[Extractive supported answer]
  H -. planned .-> R[RNN/GRU summarizer]
  X --> E[Recall@k, MRR, F1, ROUGE-L, support review]
  R --> E
